From 2c092365fd5c72efcedc29a578601b0a41ce45c4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ZXlieC <xlie7669@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 14:24:46 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] power: supply: qcom_battmgr: add opt-in Negroni charge limits

Add configurable 75/80 percent hysteresis with charge limiting disabled by default. Stop battery charging through the Oplus protocol while retaining USB input, and guard initialization, reconnect and VOOC retry paths against re-enabling charging during a hold.

Expose policy enable and acknowledged status through sysfs, retry transport failures and block system suspend while host-side enforcement is active. Keep these controls specific to Negroni.
---
 drivers/power/supply/qcom_battmgr.c           | 427 +++++++++++++++++-
 .../power/supply/qcom_battmgr_charge_limit.h  |  31 ++
 2 files changed, 447 insertions(+), 11 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 drivers/power/supply/qcom_battmgr_charge_limit.h

diff --git a/drivers/power/supply/qcom_battmgr.c b/drivers/power/supply/qcom_battmgr.c
index 7edfd3521718..10505952846b 100644
--- a/drivers/power/supply/qcom_battmgr.c
